          "name": "Get the deterministic credit picture",
          "request": {
            "name": "Get the deterministic credit picture",
            "description": {
              "content": "Returns the normalized `spread` (adjusted EBITDA/net income, DSCR, margins,\ndebt-to-worth, current ratio, reserve months, LTV, sensitivity table, per-metric\nprovenance), the `adjustments` line items (tagged `ai` or `lo`), and the policy\nengine `decision` with every rule's pass/fail. Values come from a versioned\ncalculation engine, not from an LLM. Layers are null until computed.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
